1202:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../core/lv_obj_style_gen.h ****  * Get how to align the lines of the text. Note that it doesn't align the Widget
1203:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../core/lv_obj_style_gen.h ****  * itself, only the lines inside the Widget. Possible values are
1204:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../core/lv_obj_style_gen.h ****  * `LV_TEXT_ALIGN_LEFT/CENTER/RIGHT/AUTO`. `LV_TEXT_ALIGN_AUTO` detect the text base
